  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI wanted to ask if the following could be implemented in the future.\n1. The ability to move the individual menu items in the top right corner of their order. In other words, to customize them, for example, if I prefer the pen (editing) to the right of the magnifying glass.\n2. In #2165, which I initiated, it says that Docker should be added to the bar again, as it was in 0.15. Could an additional function be added that allows users to decide for themselves whether they want additional functions (icons) in this bar or not? For example, if more icons were added at the top in the future.\n\nSo 1. Change the order and 2. decide for yourself what should and should not be in the bar.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/718cf9d5-37af-4740-b8a2-9197797680f8)\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
